---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About Smart Home Tips"
  description="About Smart Home Tips, our editorial approach, and how we help UK readers choose smart-home products."
>
  <section class="page">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>Practical smart-home advice for UK homes.</h1>
    <p>
      Smart Home Tips helps readers compare smart-home devices, understand compatibility, and plan setups
      that are reliable, secure, and sensible for real homes.
    </p>
    <p>
      We focus on buying guides, product comparisons, setup checklists, troubleshooting, and plain-English
      explanations of ecosystems such as Alexa, Google Home, Apple Home, Matter, Zigbee, Z-Wave, and Home Assistant.
    </p>

    <h2>How we make recommendations</h2>
    <p>
      Our guides prioritise compatibility, setup difficulty, ongoing costs, privacy considerations, UK availability,
      and value for money. Older guides are reviewed and improved as products, prices, and smart-home standards change.
    </p>

    <h2>How the site earns money</h2>
    <p>
      Some articles include affiliate links. If you buy through those links, Smart Home Tips may earn a commission
      at no extra cost to you. This supports the site and helps fund better guides.
    </p>
    <p><a href="/affiliate-disclosure">Read the affiliate disclosure</a>.</p>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .page { max-width: 760px; }
  h1 { margin: 0.25rem 0 1rem; font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.4rem); line-height: 1.02; }
  h2 { margin-top: 2rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  p { margin-bottom: 1rem; color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.03rem; }
</style>
